 "notes": "Pages 1-35. Hydrology report with a solute-transport model; model input parameters (Table 2, Table 3) and simulated velocities/leakages were not recorded as field values. Figure 4 (p. 14) stratigraphic column is garbled in the text layer; the Santee Limestone name is read from fragments of that figure and flagged inferred. Table 1 (p. 17) per-sample core values (Beaufort County wells 1672-1809) were not recorded individually; the summary statistics given in the text are recorded. Formation descriptions of the Waccamaw, Pamlico and Talbot are attributed in the text to an unpublished 1960 report by Siple. Figure maps (pp. 10, 12, 16, 21, 24, 25) are mostly garbled and skipped.",
